The story follows a gentle pacifist bull named Ferdinand who refuses to participate in bullfighting but is forced back
into the arena where his beliefs are challenged when he faces off against the world's greatest bullfighter.

17
01:23:27,272 --> 01:23:33,272
Ferdinand premiered on December 10, 2017, in Los Angeles, and was theatrically
released in the United States on December 15, 2017 by 20th Century Fox.

18
01:28:21,818 --> 01:28:27,818
It received mixed reviews from critics and underperformed domestically, but fared better
internationally, grossing $296 million worldwide against a production budget of $111 million.

19
